  "question": "Which fast food is nearest along the route connecting Meadow Museum, Benson, NC to Smithfield Community Park, Smithfield, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.457419 35.320622)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.32926 35.528601)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.457419 35.320622)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.457419 35.320622)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
